OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the future hold for
OL,4,Acounty's first wild beavers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Pensthorpe Natural Park
OL,7,Fannounced that a pair of beaver babies,
OL,8,For kits, had been born in the wild in
OL,9,FNorfolk for the first time in 500
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FOne of their parents was first spotted
OL,13,Fon the 700-acre conservation site near
OL,14,FFakenham in November 2025, with another
OL,15,Fadult beaver soon joining.
OL,17,FA few months later, the kits were born
OL,18,Fand have since been learning to play
OL,19,Fand feed in an undisclosed area of the
OL,20,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
